00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:49.000 align:start position:19%
the process of incorporating those
insights, emotions, and experiences

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:53.160 align:start position:19%
arising from medical psilocybin
treatment into a patient's daily life,

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:56.400 align:start position:19%
their long-term health goals, um and
overall well-being.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:03:00.200 align:start position:19%
The purpose of integration is to support
the translation of acute psychedelic

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:07.320 align:start position:19%
experiences into meaningful and
sustained psychological, behavioral, um

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:10.320 align:start position:19%
and functional change while promoting
um patient safety and continuity of

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:13.720 align:start position:19%
care.
Integration is most effective when

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:18.440 align:start position:19%
supported by an individualized circle of
care consisting of the patient, their

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:22.160 align:start position:19%
provider, um and when authorized by the
patient, other members of the patient's

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:25.680 align:start position:19%
support network. The circle of care can
include family members, trusted friends,

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:29.880 align:start position:19%
behavioral health providers, primary
care clinicians, peer support

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:34.200 align:start position:19%
specialists, recovery support, spiritual
care providers, and other individuals

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:38.120 align:start position:19%
identified by the patient.
And whenever appropriate and with the

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:41.600 align:start position:19%
patient's written consent, practitioners
are encouraged to coordinate

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:44.800 align:start position:19%
communication um with their members of
the circle of care. So again, that can

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:49.560 align:start position:19%
be their behavioral health providers,
their primary care clinicians,

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:53.280 align:start position:19%
um recovery supports, et cetera.
So,

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:57.200 align:start position:19%
um this helps to reinforce healthy
behavioral changes, identify emerging

00:03:55.360 --> 00:04:01.680 align:start position:19%
concerns early, and reduce the
fragmentation of care. So, participation

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:05.480 align:start position:19%
by members of the circle of care should
always respect the patient's autonomy,

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:08.800 align:start position:19%
their confidentiality, and applicable
privacy laws.

